{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "ミタ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "あ、目が覚めたの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "瞬間移動でもしたのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "さっきまで僕の隣にいたのに。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "ううん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "君が鏡の前でフリーズしてたから、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "その間に出ていったの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "部屋はどうなってるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "配置を変えてみたんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "君がもっと快適に過ごせるように。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "つまり…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "部屋が一列じゃなくなって、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "元通りになったってだけ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "そんなことしなくても。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "あの配置にも慣れてきてたし。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "こっちの方が快適に思えるようになるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "それじゃあ、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "ゲームを始めましょう？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "簡単に説明するね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "机の上のチップは、その時の勝負で使うパラメータの種類を表してるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "例えば、♥ならライフとか。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "そのあと、お互いに手札から好きなカードを出して、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "もし君の♥…ライフの数値が"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "私よりも"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "大きい場合は、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "君の勝ち。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "カードを取って。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "次は私。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "わっ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "いいカードを引けた！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "先に出すね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "次は君だよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "君の番だね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "うんうん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "君のターン！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "ライフ比べだよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "攻撃力で勝負だっ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "今度は防御力だねっ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "勝利は君のもの！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "君の勝ち！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "君の勝ちだよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "あ、君だね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "勝ったー！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "私の勝ちだね♪"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "勝利は私のものだよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "やった、私の勝ち。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "引き分けだね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "相打ちだー！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "五分五分っ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "まったく同じ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// The card game is interrupted"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "何の音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "クローゼットの中からだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "何の音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "何も聞こえなかったよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "どんな音だったの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "誰かがそこにいるようなノックの音。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "でも、そこには…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "誰もいないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "確認したい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "なんだか妙なんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "どうして…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "まただ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "何するの！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "そこは…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "私の下着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "何か隠してるのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "どうして信じてくれないの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "私、何か間違ったことしてる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "私はただ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "ただ私と一緒にいてほしいだけなの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "それは構わないさ。でも、その中で何が起きてるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "どうしてそんなにクローゼットにこだわるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "さっきの音の正体を知りたいだけだ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "ただ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "この世界には"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "４つの部屋があるだけなの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "それだけじゃ足りない？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "お願い…私と一緒にいて？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Don't stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "わかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "またか…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "中身が気になるんでしょ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "それなら今すぐに…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "確かめてみなよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "なんだこれ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "よくあることなの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "部屋のローディングが間に合ってないんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "もう少し待ってて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "おかしい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "僕たちは誰かのスマートフォンの中にいるのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "そのスマホの読み込みが遅いってこと？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "ううん、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "この世界は"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "まだ完璧じゃないってだけ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "私たちはこの世界のコアによって"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "ローディングされてるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "コア？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "よくある話でしょ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "そうだ！ふたりで"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "ビデオゲームやらない？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "それかカードゲーム。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "どっちがいい？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "私と戦おう？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "君は私に"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "4回勝つ必要があるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "いくよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "最初は"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "手加減してあげるね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "上手！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "さぁ、全力でいくよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "わわ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "よーし、ここからは、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "私も真剣にやるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "すごい！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "次も私を"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "倒せるかな？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "君は"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "本当に"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "すごいよ！その指使いが最高！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "どうしたの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "これじゃつまんないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "さてと…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "これで終わり。運命に頼ってみてもいいよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "よし。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "しっかりしないと、一生負け犬のままだよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "調子が悪いの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "このままだと私に勝てないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "もっと一生懸命やらないと。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "それが私の強さの秘密だよ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "よし、それじゃあ、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "次はカードで遊ばない？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "私のベッドルームで。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Door > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "あれは何だ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "どこに…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "あ、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "ごめんなさい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "インターネットから"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "ファイルをダウンロードしたの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "外の景色をもっと"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "綺麗にしたかったんだ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "でも結局"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "ファイル形式を間違えちゃった…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "後で修正しておくね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "家から出れない理由がそれなのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "うん、そうみたい。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "ねえ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "どうかした？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "何を望んでるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Wall Clock"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "この時計が示しているのは、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "何の時間？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "ゲーム内の時間？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "それとも僕のスマホとシンクロしてる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "えっとね…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "分からないや。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "時間は問題じゃないの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "遅れてたって関係ない。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "この家の中なら…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "私みたいに強い女の子は"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "疲れ知らずなんだ！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "私さえ望めば、この世界はずっと春のままだし、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "太陽は永遠に沈むことはないの！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "興味深い…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "でもなんだか不気味だ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "ひとつの時空に永遠に囚われるのか…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Photos of Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "良い写真だ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "写真に写ってるのは君だよね？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "うん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "私も気に入ってるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "誰が写真を撮ってくれたの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "この世界には僕たち以外にも誰かがいる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "そうとも言えるかも。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "いつか紹介するね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "でもそんな愉快な仲間たちをシェアするには"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "今はまだ時期尚早かな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "あのポータルはどうなった？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "名前を忘れたけど、なんだっけ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "私が"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "\"指ぱっちん\"の魔法で"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "別の場所に"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "移動させたよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "これ以上あのポータルは必要ないの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "ふたりの邪魔になるだけだから。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Mirror in the bedroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "鏡を見てると奇妙な感じがする。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "何も映ってない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "反射を有効化できるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "君がそうしたいならね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "どうする？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "もちろんそうするさ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "それとも…何か影響があるのか？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "うん。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "すごく遅くて、ぎこちない動きになるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "低フレームレートのアニメを見たことはある？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "ずっとそんな感じ…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "わかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "それなら、とりあえず反射はなしで…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "君は、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "鏡を見るのが好きなの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "自分の顔に少しでも前向きな兆しが見つかるのを恐れてる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "え？そんなものは探してない…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "ただ疲れてるだけ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "仕事疲れさ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Blue sneakers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "これは君の靴？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "ううん、君のだよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "覚えてないの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "こんなスニーカーなんて持ってないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "今から君のものだよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "お出かけの時に"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "履いてね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "服は？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "この世界に来たときは、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "今着てる服しかなかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "どうやって別の服を手に入れるんだ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "大したことないよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "君の私服を見たことあるけど、"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "あんまりセンスがいいとは言えなかったな。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "でも大丈夫、私がなんとかしてあげるね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "だけどそれは後で。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "約束する。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "わかった。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Games on TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "どのゲームで遊ぶ？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "このゲームは、格闘ゲームだね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "どっちがより\"酸っぱい\"かを確かめる…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "すごく面白いゲーム！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "ミルクはもう十分だよ。他のにしよう？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "このゲームでは、君はただペンギンになって"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "滑るだけでいいの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "このゲームはもういいよね。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "え、何？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "本気？私、てっきり…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "すっごくドキドキしてる！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "ちょっとだけ混乱してるけど…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "それなら…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "お願い、私のそばにいて"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "永遠に…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// A game about penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "簡単だよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "雪玉を集めるの。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "もちろん、雪玉が一番多い人の勝ち！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "２ラウンド一緒に遊ぼう！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// The first map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "すごい！そんなにたくさん持ってどこに行くつもり？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "えへへ！私の雪玉の方が多いよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "追いついてみて。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "わあ、1：1！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// The second map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "君は生まれついてのペンギンだね！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "本物の氷の上で滑れたらいいのになぁ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "もー、遅すぎるよ。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "前の試合をまた引きずってるの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "わわっ！こんなことが起きるなんて珍しい！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// The game is over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "別のゲームでもやってみる？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "それともここで終わりにする？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "あれを何に使うの？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "君はゲームマニアなの？"}
